{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X 在 S08 省掉了“今天这样好不代表以后每天都能这样”的明确担忧，导致 S09 的未来焦虑少了一层心理铺垫。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 的重点词放大加亮、感受字小，再配合乐句到时出现，观众可以先抓住故事主线，再在听觉对应的位置接住细腻变化，不必同时处理所有信息。反复出现的水波、小船、摇荡与停泊也形成了贯穿始终的意象，让情绪发展更像一件完整的事。Y 在人物心理动机的解释上更充分，尤其是害怕给对方造成负担、对未来关系的担忧，交代得更明确；但右侧短词较容易成为并列的感受标签，情绪变化的层次和音乐细节不如 X 丰富。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9bde618e-b7e7-4474-a28a-db7d421e55a3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T090718803660Z", "elapsed_seconds": 125.828, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T09:09:24.639971+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a3ba10539970571db5bb30927cc55ab800546349790a02dc53febc9f33a0e42e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\